    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage <strong>Little</strong> <strong>Rigmen</strong> that will do all the work of e<strong>xtracting Oil</strong> for you.\u00a0 <br><strong>Defend against Pirates</strong> whilst trying to make <strong>as much Profit</strong> as possible!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD AND UPGRADE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build</strong> <strong>your own Oil Rig</strong>, select from a <strong>variety of buildings</strong>, and build the most <strong>efficient pipeline</strong> to extract Oil from the <strong>underground deposits</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591010/extras/46c7bdfdc7bee6e8636f142fd3a2c85d.poster.avif?t=1749400434\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591010/extras/46c7bdfdc7bee6e8636f142fd3a2c85d.webm?t=1749400434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591010/extras/46c7bdfdc7bee6e8636f142fd3a2c85d.mp4?t=1749400434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CONTROL YOUR CREW IN FIRST PERSON</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Equip your Rigmen</strong> with different weapons to <strong>Fight the Pirate Raids</strong>. <br><strong>Take Control of a Rigman </strong>and <strong>Shoot Back</strong>, or let them handle it for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591010/extras/c43ef0ea390c4dc2614b2ce7ae4544f0.poster.avif?t=1749400434\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591010/extras/c43ef0ea390c4dc2614b2ce7ae4544f0.webm?t=1749400434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591010/extras/c43ef0ea390c4dc2614b2ce7ae4544f0.mp4?t=1749400434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEEP UP WITH MAINTANCE OR ELSE ...\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rigmen</strong> need to <strong>fix the Leaks</strong> and <strong>put out the Fires </strong>before it's too late. <br>You can <strong>equip</strong> your crew with <strong>Fire Extinguishers, Toolkits</strong>, <strong>Weapons</strong>\u00a0and much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591010/extras/cfcce1d478641cf99d282fbaefd8fda9.poster.avif?t=1749400434\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591010/extras/cfcce1d478641cf99d282fbaefd8fda9.webm?t=1749400434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591010/extras/cfcce1d478641cf99d282fbaefd8fda9.mp4?t=1749400434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FOR UPDATES, SUGGESTIONS AND ROADMAP\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your own Suggestions and Ideas </strong>can<strong>\u00a0</strong>shape the <strong>Game's Future</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591010/extras/ae284364979dfc5b80de804aa19610d6.avif?t=1749400434\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage <strong>Little</strong> <strong>Rigmen</strong> that will do all the work of e<strong>xtracting Oil</strong> for you.\u00a0 <br><strong>Defend against Pirates</strong> whilst trying to make <strong>as much Profit</strong> as possible!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD AND UPGRADE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build</strong> <strong>your own Oil Rig</strong>, select from a <strong>variety of buildings</strong>, and build the most <strong>efficient pipeline</strong> to extract Oil from the <strong>underground deposits</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591010/extras/46c7bdfdc7bee6e8636f142fd3a2c85d.poster.avif?t=1749400434\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591010/extras/46c7bdfdc7bee6e8636f142fd3a2c85d.webm?t=1749400434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591010/extras/46c7bdfdc7bee6e8636f142fd3a2c85d.mp4?t=1749400434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CONTROL YOUR CREW IN FIRST PERSON</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Equip your Rigmen</strong> with different weapons to <strong>Fight the Pirate Raids</strong>. <br><strong>Take Control of a Rigman </strong>and <strong>Shoot Back</strong>, or let them handle it for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591010/extras/c43ef0ea390c4dc2614b2ce7ae4544f0.poster.avif?t=1749400434\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591010/extras/c43ef0ea390c4dc2614b2ce7ae4544f0.webm?t=1749400434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591010/extras/c43ef0ea390c4dc2614b2ce7ae4544f0.mp4?t=1749400434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEEP UP WITH MAINTANCE OR ELSE ...\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rigmen</strong> need to <strong>fix the Leaks</strong> and <strong>put out the Fires </strong>before it's too late. <br>You can <strong>equip</strong> your crew with <strong>Fire Extinguishers, Toolkits</strong>, <strong>Weapons</strong>\u00a0and much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591010/extras/cfcce1d478641cf99d282fbaefd8fda9.poster.avif?t=1749400434\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591010/extras/cfcce1d478641cf99d282fbaefd8fda9.webm?t=1749400434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591010/extras/cfcce1d478641cf99d282fbaefd8fda9.mp4?t=1749400434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FOR UPDATES, SUGGESTIONS AND ROADMAP\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your own Suggestions and Ideas </strong>can<strong>\u00a0</strong>shape the <strong>Game's Future</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591010/extras/ae284364979dfc5b80de804aa19610d6.avif?t=1749400434\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p>",
